Package: retrovdp-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Cisco Garcia
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0
Description: Graphics workspace for classic video display processors
 RetroVDP Studio prepares, converts, edits, validates, and exports graphics for
 target VDP profiles. It includes hardware-aware graphical editors and a CLI.
Homepage: https://github.com/CiscoGarciaFL/retrovdp-studio
